### unescaped greater than between two variables
[ $newer > $older ] && echo "after"
>>> SC2073 1:10
>>> SC2086 1:12
>>> SC2086 1:3
>>> SC2154 1:12
>>> SC2154 1:3

### dash dialect without the double bracket hint
#!/bin/dash
[ $newer > $older ] && echo "after"
>>> SC2073 2:10
>>> SC2086 2:12
>>> SC2086 2:3
>>> SC2154 2:12
>>> SC2154 2:3

### quoted greater than is fine
[ "$newer" ">" "$older" ] && echo "after"
>>> SC2154 1:17
>>> SC2154 1:4

### sh dialect is fine
#!/bin/sh
[ $newer > $older ] && echo "after"
>>> SC2086 2:12
>>> SC2086 2:3
>>> SC2154 2:12
>>> SC2154 2:3
>>> SC3012 2:10

### numeric side goes to SC2071 instead
[ $newer > 5 ] && echo "after"
>>> SC2071 1:10
>>> SC2086 1:3
>>> SC2154 1:3
